    "body": "## Roadmap\nAdvances the P1 authorization/privacy/IDOR audit (#957; related #615/#618/#620).\n\n## What changed\n- reject missing/transient principals at `/users/me/service-categories` before calling the private service\n- require a persistent user id inside `UserServiceCategoryService` before any category or relation repository access\n- reuse the verified user id for owner-scoped relation reads\n- add controller and service regression tests asserting zero downstream/repository interactions when identity is absent\n\n## Security rationale\nPrivate specialization state must fail closed. A missing or non-persistent principal should never become a null dereference or allow repository access before identity is established.\n\n## Validation\nExact-head CI and review-thread gates are required before merge. Do not merge with any relevant check pending or failing.",
